# Design folder documentation

When editing files under `_designs/`, use the design tracker docs as the authority instead of restating their guidance here.

## Start here

- Read `_designs/README.md` for the design tracker overview, canonical locations, slash-command flow, and agent operating guidance.
- Read `_designs/WORKFLOW.md` for status definitions, verification requirements, consolidation policy, and agent responsibilities.

## Follow linked sources

- Use `_designs/feature-catalog.md`, relevant files in `_designs/stories/`, `_designs/architecture/`, and `_designs/decisions/`, and templates in `_designs/templates/` as directed by those docs.
- If guidance appears duplicated or conflicting, preserve the canonical source and update links rather than creating another copy.
